OL,3,AIllegal off-road vehicles to be seized
OL,4,Aon the spot as police warn of 'long
OL,5,Awalk home'
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice say off-road drivers causing
OL,8,Fanti-social behaviour or damage to
OL,9,Fprotected habitats will have their
OL,10,Fvehicles seized "on the spot".
OL,12,FPC Eryl Lloyd, of North Wales Police's
OL,13,Frural crime team, said new powers
OL,14,Fallowed officers to take vehicles
OL,15,Fwithout notice, and warned offending
OL,16,Fdrivers: "It's a long walk home."
OL,18,FBoth the force and Natural Resources
OL,19,FWales (NRW) said damage caused by
OL,20,Foff-roading incidents and other
OL,21,Fanti-social behaviour was on the rise.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
